---
layout: base.njk
title: Pricing
permalink: /pricing/
description: "How to work with Halie: consultation, color analysis and wardrobe audit, shopping, event and photoshoot styling, and ongoing edits."
---
<div class="wrap page-head"><p class="kicker">Ways to work together</p><h1>Pricing</h1><p class="lede">{{ packages.intro }}</p></div>
<section class="band" style="padding-top:1.5rem">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="packages">
    {%- for p in packages.packages %}
      <div class="package">
        <p class="kicker">{{ p.for }}</p>
        <h3>{{ p.name }}</h3>
        <p>{{ p.body }}</p>
        <p class="price">{% if p.price %}{{ p.price }}{% else %}Ask at your consultation{% endif %}</p>
      </div>
    {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top:2rem;color:var(--ink-2)">{{ packages.note }}</p>
  </div>
</section>
{% include "testimonials.njk" %}
